# Close soft-preserved / HLS-origin sessions for other channels on Activate (zap).
# After #807 soft-preserve, flipping channels left adaptive/HLS/Catchup sessions and
# provider TCP until TTL. Backend nuclear close + ghost lease fix (3.3.108):
# - terminate other virtual_ids for same user (single-client or matching IP)
# - release streamless counted leases (empty Streams + nonzero connections)
# - auto-close on update_connection; cancel_token on provider release
# - no double-increment on preserved HLS reactivate
# FE: keep upstream #807 soft-preserve between HLS segments (do not hard-remove on
# Disconnected*) so live rows do not blink; zap UI uses prune_zapped_preserved_streams.
# Apply BEFORE user-hide-adult.patch.

